    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "From Suffering to Praise"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director: according to “The Deer of the Dawn.” A psalm of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My God, my God, why have you abandoned me?",
          "Why are you so far from my deliverance",
          "and from my words of groaning?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My God, I cry by day, but you do not answer,",
          "by night, yet I have no rest."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But you are holy,",
          "enthroned on the praises of Israel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Our ancestors trusted in you;",
          "they trusted, and you rescued them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They cried to you and were set free;",
          "they trusted in you and were not disgraced."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But I am a worm and not a man,",
          "scorned by mankind and despised by people."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Everyone who sees me mocks me;",
          "they sneer and shake their heads:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“He relies on the Lord;",
          "let him save him;",
          "let the Lord rescue him,",
          "since he takes pleasure in him.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "It was you who brought me out of the womb,",
          "making me secure at my mother’s breast."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I was given over to you at birth;",
          "you have been my God from my mother’s womb."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t be far from me, because distress is near",
          "and there’s no one to help."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Many bulls surround me;",
          "strong ones of Bashan encircle me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They open their mouths against me —",
          "lions, mauling and roaring."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I am poured out like water,",
          "and all my bones are disjointed;",
          "my heart is like wax,",
          "melting within me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My strength is dried up like baked clay;",
          "my tongue sticks to the roof of my mouth.",
          "You put me into the dust of death."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For dogs have surrounded me;",
          "a gang of evildoers has closed in on me;",
          "they pierced my hands and my feet."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I can count all my bones;",
          "people look and stare at me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They divided my garments among themselves,",
          "and they cast lots for my clothing."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But you, Lord, don’t be far away.",
          "My strength, come quickly to help me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Rescue my life from the sword,",
          "my only life from the power of these dogs."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Save me from the lion’s mouth,",
          "from the horns of wild oxen.",
          "You answered me!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will proclaim your name to my brothers and sisters;",
          "I will praise you in the assembly."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You who fear the Lord, praise him!",
          "All you descendants of Jacob, honor him!",
          "All you descendants of Israel, revere him!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For he has not despised or abhorred",
          "the torment of the oppressed.",
          "He did not hide his face from him",
          "but listened when he cried to him for help."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will give praise in the great assembly",
          "because of you;",
          "I will fulfill my vows",
          "before those who fear you. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The humble will eat and be satisfied;",
          "those who seek the Lord will praise him.",
          "May your hearts live forever!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "All the ends of the earth will remember",
          "and turn to the Lord.",
          "All the families of the nations",
          "will bow down before you,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for kingship belongs to the Lord;",
          "he rules the nations."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "All who prosper on earth will eat and bow down;",
          "all those who go down to the dust",
          "will kneel before him —",
          "even the one who cannot preserve his life."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Their descendants will serve him;",
          "the next generation will be told about the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They will come and declare his righteousness;",
          "to a people yet to be born",
          "they will declare what he has done."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
